 requesting client

Backport herdrdev/herdr@8be4cf765afddfd9cf3206602ba4dab682a29fa1. Keep cancellation and endpoint-generation fences on the normal client-local TabFocus path.

Refs herdrdev/herdr#3787, herdrdev/herdr#3766.
